WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.611
Karpathy had Claude

00:00:01.423 --> 00:00:02.779
turn 31 US

00:00:02.591 --> 00:00:03.805
public datasets

00:00:04.326 --> 00:00:05.493
Using Claude Code

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.026
with Opus 5.5

00:00:07.121 --> 00:00:08.406
Andrej Karpathy built

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:08.948
usaciv

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.623
which reconciles Census

00:00:10.706 --> 00:00:11.401
BEA

00:00:11.543 --> 00:00:12.816
BLS NOAA

00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:14.561
USGS and other

00:00:14.373 --> 00:00:15.304
data onto a

00:00:15.116 --> 00:00:17.215
25 km hex grid

00:00:17.026 --> 00:00:18.441
with 19 lenses

00:00:18.982 --> 00:00:20.125
Real data maps

00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:21.246
onto game concepts

00:00:21.364 --> 00:00:22.814
GDP becomes gold

00:00:22.626 --> 00:00:23.262
yield

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:24.607
a city's districts

00:00:24.418 --> 00:00:25.349
are its industry

00:00:25.161 --> 00:00:26.364
specializations

00:00:26.435 --> 00:00:27.437
and wonders are

00:00:27.248 --> 00:00:28.557
chosen by published

00:00:28.369 --> 00:00:29.382
rules such as

00:00:29.194 --> 00:00:30.385
park visitors and

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:32.024
university R&D spending

00:00:32.558 --> 00:00:33.808
The Explorer turns

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.586
any column for

00:00:34.398 --> 00:00:34.975
3

00:00:35.223 --> 00:00:36.779
100 + counties

00:00:36.591 --> 00:00:37.675
into a table

00:00:37.487 --> 00:00:38.619
and scatter plot

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:39.126
linked to the

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:39.550
map

00:00:40.086 --> 00:00:41.100
Full story on

00:00:40.911 --> 00:00:41.807
the dashboard
